From 518faa2e39a95569c9999428bbd01e599f14429e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:55:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] TEACH-ZDISABLED: the Teach page's Z-at-home checks skip a
 non-1203 axis whose Mot_Table Enable is 0 (MTestZ2 no longer blocks the
 shuttles)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 20261001: "shuttle 被擋 如果 testz2 enable 是0 那就不要擋testz2". On this HT9050 MTestZ2 is an SMC row with Enable=0; with
IO_CARD_TYPE=4 / INDEX_MOTION_CARD=0 golden builds it as a TMyGALILMotor with Motor->Enable=true (cinitial.cpp:3943-3975), and with
no card the Galil scan never writes its home LED -> IsCanQuickJogMove refused every shuttle move with "Please let MTestZ2 at home
position first!!". golden's other drivers (SMC / MN200 / EtherCAT) already report a disabled axis as home; only the Galil arm does not.
New MotorAccessTeachInterlockHome (WebMotorAccess.cpp, end of file): a non-1203 axis with Mot_Table Enable 0 returns -3 -> fTeach
W906_TeachHomeLed treats it as at home (deviation, commented); everything else is MotorAccessTeachHomeLed as before (1203 ORG
LOW = home on HT9050, no sample = not home). The engine's W906_HookHt9050OrgHome is untouched. An enabled axis with an unknown home
state is still refused.
Tests: WebMotorAccess (the -3 / -2 / 1203 cases) and GaliRouteEngine part 15 (the real TfTeach::IsCanQuickJogMove: Z2 disabled
-> allowed; Z2 enabled + LED false -> the golden message; Z1 unknown -> refused). Both pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 WebMotorAccess.cpp               | 13 +++++++++
 WebMotorAccess.h                 |  4 +++
 WebMotorAccessLive.cpp           |  2 +-
 forms/fTeach.cpp                 |  3 +-
 forms/fTeach.h                   |  2 +-
 tests/test_gali_route_engine.cpp | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/test_web_motor_access.cpp  | 27 ++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/WebMotorAccess.cpp b/WebMotorAccess.cpp
index d837148..06c3d2b 100644
--- a/WebMotorAccess.cpp
+++ b/WebMotorAccess.cpp
@@ -5066,3 +5066,16 @@ bool LsStartGoldenHome(IMotorAccessBackend& be, int mi, const std::string& alias
 
 }  // namespace
 }  // namespace ht9045
+
+//AI(W906-TEACH-ZDISABLED) 20261001: EastSun 1001「如果 testz2 enable 是0 那就不要擋testz2」—— 合約在 WebMotorAccess.h（MotorAccessTeachInterlockHome）。
+//  放在檔尾：本檔行號被別處引用（docs、WebCmdGuard.cpp），不推動它們。
+namespace ht9045 {
+int MotorAccessTeachInterlockHome(IMotorAccessBackend& be, int mi)
+{
+    std::string alias;
+    MotorAccessAxis a;
+    if (be.AliasOfMotIndex(mi, alias) && be.Resolve(alias, a) && !a.Is1203() && !a.tableEnable)
+        return -3;                                                              // 這台沒裝這一軸（Mot_Table 的 Enable 欄，同 1203 路徑用的 tableEnable）⇒ Teach 互鎖不檢查它
+    return MotorAccessTeachHomeLed(be, mi);                                     // 其餘一格不變：1203 軸（ORG 規則、Enable=0＝1）、Enable=1 的非 1203 軸（-2＝golden HOME 燈，false 照樣擋）、表上沒有（-2）
+}
+}  // namespace ht9045
diff --git a/WebMotorAccess.h b/WebMotorAccess.h
index 53dc28f..a64cf3d 100644
--- a/WebMotorAccess.h
+++ b/WebMotorAccess.h
@@ -566,6 +566,10 @@ extern bool (*g_W906OrgActiveLow)();
 // 純函式（測試直接驗）：orgBit＝motionIO bit 4；sensorType＝Motor->bSensorType；cardOrgLogic＝卡片的 CFG_AxOrgLogic（不是 0／1 ⇒ -1 不明）
 int  MotorAccessOrgHomeLed(bool orgBit, bool sensorType, int cardOrgLogic);
 int  MotorAccessTeachHomeLed(IMotorAccessBackend& be, int motIndex);
+//AI(W906-TEACH-ZDISABLED) 20261001: EastSun 1001「如果 testz2 enable 是0 那就不要擋testz2」—— Teach 互鎖（forms/fTeach.cpp W906_TeachHomeLedHook）用這支：
+//  Mot_Table Enable=0 而且不是 PCI1203 的軸 → -3（不檢查＝當成在原點；golden 的 SMC／MN200／EtherCAT Enable=false 也是 HOME 燈＝true，只有 INDEX_MOTION_CARD==0
+//  的 Galil 分支不管表上 Enable 一律開 MTestY1/Z2/Y2，無卡時 HOME 燈永遠不寫）。其餘＝MotorAccessTeachHomeLed 原樣（1203 軸、Enable=1、表上沒有）。引擎的掛勾不用這支。
+int  MotorAccessTeachInterlockHome(IMotorAccessBackend& be, int motIndex);
 bool MotorAccessTeachLive1203(IMotorAccessBackend& be, int motIndex);
 // 最近一次 MotorAccessTeachHomeLed 回 -1 的原因（TeachPrelude 用來把「不明」講清楚；空＝沒有）
 std::string MotorAccessTeachHomeUnknownWhy();
